title: Add pallet-gas-allowance with ChargePGAS transaction extension
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: "## Summary\n\n- Introduces `pallet-gas-allowance` providing a new\
    \ `ChargePGAS<T, S>` transaction extension that wraps an inner fee extension `S`.\n\
    - When a signed transaction dispatches a call matching `Config::CallFilter` and\
    \ the signer holds enough PGAS (a foreign asset, id is a `Location`), the fee\
    \ is withdrawn as a `fungibles::Credit`. In `post_dispatch` the credit is split:\
    \ the `actual_fee` portion is dropped (burning total issuance via `OnDropCredit`)\
    \ and the unused remainder is `resolve`d back to the payer. Otherwise the inner\
    \ extension runs unchanged.\n- Wires the extension into `asset-hub-westend` around\
    \ `ChargeAssetTxPayment`, with the filter matching `pallet-revive` calls and PGAS\
    \ pointing at `Parachain(PEOPLE_ID) / GeneralIndex(0)`.\n\n## Flow\n\n1. `validate`:\
    \ unsigned origin or filter miss \u2192 delegate to inner. Signed + filter hit\
    \ + `balance(PGAS) >= fee` \u2192 tag as PGAS path.\n2. `prepare`: `Balanced::withdraw(fee)`\
    \ \u2192 `Credit` stored in `Pre::PGAS`.\n3. `post_dispatch_details`: split `Credit`\
    \ by `actual_fee`; `resolve` refund to payer; drop consumed portion (burns issuance).\n\
    \nThe imbalance-based flow mirrors `FungibleAdapter::correct_and_deposit_fee`\
    \ in `pallet-transaction-payment`.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `cargo test -p pallet-gas-allowance`\
    \ \u2014 7 tests:\n  - `pgas_pays_for_filtered_call_with_zero_native` (zero DOT,\
    \ enough PGAS \u2192 PGAS burns, DOT unchanged)\n  - `falls_back_to_inner_when_no_pgas`\n\
    \  - `filter_miss_uses_inner_even_with_pgas`\n  - `pgas_refund_on_unused_weight`\
    \ (verifies refund via `resolve`)\n  - `unsigned_delegates_to_inner`\n  - mock\
    \ construct-runtime integrity + genesis builder\n- [x] `cargo check -p asset-hub-westend-runtime`\n\
    - [x] `cargo check -p pallet-gas-allowance --all-targets --all-features`\n- [\
    \ ] CI runs full workspace build / clippy / tests\n- [ ] prdoc added\n\n## Follow-ups\n\
    \n- Benchmarks & weights for `ChargePGAS`."
crates:
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: minor
- name: pallet-gas-allowance
  bump: minor
